 "note": "SN74LS646 (scanned SDLS190A, same file as sdls190a): clocks CAB/CBA and output enable G (sn74ls646 p.1 pinout, DW/NT and SN54 JT); same positions as 74_646. Function table sn74ls646 p.2 (LS646 column): Function table (all 646 PDFs): G H = isolation (both ports read, registers still clock); G L + DIR L: SBA L = real-time B to A, SBA H = stored B to A; G L + DIR H: SAB L = real-time A to B, SAB H = stored A to B; CAB/CBA rising edge stores the A/B bus whatever G/DIR are. SN74LS646NT3 is an NT orderable not in the packaging table (only SN74LS646DW). Timing p.8, VCC p.7.",
